	measure 'Pareto Best-selling Revenue' = ```
			
			VAR __Threshold = [Param: Pareto Threshold Value]
			VAR __AllRevenue = CALCULATE([Order Items Total Revenue], ALLSELECTED(DIM_PRODUCTS))
			
			RETURN
			    SUMX(
			        FILTER(
			            ALLSELECTED(DIM_PRODUCTS[PRODUCT_CATEGORY]),
			            VAR _RunRev = [Running Total Product Revenue]
			                
			            VAR _CurrentPct = DIVIDE(_RunRev, __AllRevenue, 0)
			            RETURN
			                _CurrentPct <= __Threshold
			        ),
			        [Order Items Total Revenue]
			    )
			
			
			```
		displayFolder: 03_Product
		lineageTag: 9304614b-cb94-4b20-bc19-53e6670979d6

		formatStringDefinition = ```
